flowchart TD

Start([User Opens App])

Start --> Login[Enter Email & Password]

Login --> API[POST /auth/login]

API --> Validate{Credentials Valid?}

Validate -- No --> Unauthorized[401 Unauthorized]
Unauthorized --> Login

Validate -- Yes --> Generate[Generate JWT Tokens]

Generate --> Access[Access Token]

Generate --> Refresh[Refresh Token]

Refresh --> Store[Store Refresh Token]

Store --> Response[Return Tokens]

Response --> Protected[Access Protected APIs]

Protected --> Expired{Access Token Expired?}

Expired -- No --> Protected

Expired -- Yes --> RefreshRequest[POST /auth/refresh]

RefreshRequest --> VerifyRefresh{Refresh Token Valid?}

VerifyRefresh -- Yes --> NewTokens[Issue New Access Token]

NewTokens --> Protected

VerifyRefresh -- No --> Login